$ weave agents --help
The agents weave launches: list them, move them to their newest releases, sign in to or out of one, or try one with a prompt

Usage: weave agents [COMMAND]

Commands:
  list    The agents `--agent` accepts: presets, the config's, and the ACP registry's (the default)
  update  Move the agents weave launches to their newest releases, after checking each starts
  login   Sign in to the agent with one of the methods it offers
  logout  Sign out of the agent, if it supports signing out
  smoke   Run one prompt headlessly and print every ACP event the agent sends
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help
          Print help

