Stop the Host if it's running, once running turns end, then start it again: after rebuilding weave

Usage: weave daemon restart [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --now
          Don't wait for running turns: stop them now. Threads they're in can be reopened later

  -h, --help
          Print help

